{"unit_id":"dingminhua__dsh-connect-qoder#card-zh","repo":"dingminhua/dsh-connect-qoder","commit":"afe199397365acffcaa49b7301684fd60fcbb86b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Connect Qoder（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 Qoder 国内版和国际版模型接入 DeepSeek Harness。它分别注册 qoder 与 qoder-global 两个模型供应商，并通过设置页连接 PAT、刷新和管理模型目录。主要功能包括按账号池测试结果自动选择与切换账号、查看各账号积分、批量领取每日签到、控制模型启用状态及上下文与思考档位。适合希望在 DSH 会话中使用 Qoder 模型并管理多个 Qoder 账号的用户。使用前需配置对应区域的 Qoder PAT；可在设置页填写，也可使用环境变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:2215-2264","src/index.ts:2115-2163","src/upstream.ts:210-231"]}
{"unit_id":"dingminhua__dsh-connect-qoder#card-en","repo":"dingminhua/dsh-connect-qoder","commit":"afe199397365acffcaa49b7301684fd60fcbb86b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Connect Qoder links Qoder China and Global models to DSH Web. It registers two regional providers and a settings page for PATs and model catalogs. Users can manage pools, switch accounts, view credits, check in daily, and adjust models, context, and reasoning. Configure a Qoder PAT per region.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:2215-2264","src/index.ts:2115-2163","src/upstream.ts:210-231"]}
